# Settings > Updates > Packages (report 047 P4): the upgrade of the safe set, on the Pi 4 B's capture (21 updates: 16 safe,
# 4 launcher libraries, 1 boot; libcurl3t64-gnutls pulls curl and libcurl4t64 (one source): it joins the libraries, 15 safe). The first action row below Refresh lists: "Upgrade 15 packages" with its download in amber;
# the confirmation page: the read-only text block (the count, the download, the disk needed, keep the board plugged in, apps
# keep running until the next restart), the switch "Launcher libraries (5)" Off ("not included" in the status line), Upgrade
# now, Cancel; the switch On: the warning line "Included: ...", the text with the libraries (20 packages); Upgrade now (env HARNESS_SUDO ok: systemd-run "returns",
# nothing runs) opens the progress page at once ("Starting the helper...  00:00" until the helper's first status); then the
# helper's status file the scene writes:
# downloading 12 of 20 (the bar, Cancel the download), installing 5 of 20 (Esc ignored, "Do not switch off"); every row of
# the progress page whole under its bar (expect_unclipped); done: the result page; Esc: back on Packages. Keys only. Review only: no golden; the headers are checked against the home grid's.
title updates upgrade
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800 480x320
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_APPS missing
env HARNESS_SUDO ok
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-01
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.9.2 release arm64
update answer releases-real.json
apt board pi4b
apt lists-age 1
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 3000
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot upgrade_row
header upgrade_row "Settings > Updates > Packages" "Updates > Packages" "Packages"
expect_text "Upgrade 15 packages"
expect_text end " MB"
expect_text "Kernel and kept-back ones: in a terminal"
# the confirmation page
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot upgrade_confirm
header upgrade_confirm "Settings > Updates > Packages > Upgrade" "Updates > Packages > Upgrade" "Packages > Upgrade" Upgrade
expect_text "Launcher libraries (5)"
expect_text "Off"
expect_text "Launcher libraries are not included"
expect_text "Upgrade now"
expect_text "Cancel"
expect_unclipped "Launcher libraries (5)" "Upgrade now" "Cancel"
# the switch on: the warning line, the libraries in the text
key ENTER
wait 400
shot upgrade_confirm_libraries
expect_text "Included: the launcher runs on these"
expect_text "On"
expect_unclipped "Launcher libraries (5)" "Upgrade now" "Cancel"
# Upgrade now: the password (taken here), the helper's unit started, its first status not written yet
key END
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
shot upgrade_starting
header upgrade_starting "Settings > Updates > Packages > Upgrading" "Updates > Packages > Upgrading" "Packages > Upgrading" Upgrading
expect_text start "Starting the helper..."
expect_unclipped "Check the plan" "Download" "Install" "Clean up"
# downloading
apt upgrade job upgrade
apt upgrade state running
apt upgrade phase download
apt upgrade done 12
apt upgrade total 20
apt upgrade percent 60
apt upgrade text Retrieving file 12 of 20
apt upgrade libraries 1
apt upgrade user pi
apt upgrade started now-0
apt upgrade log /var/log/cyberdeckzero/apt-upgrade-20261101-203000.log
wait 1500
shot upgrade_download
expect_text start "Downloading 12 of 20"
expect_text "Cancel the download"
expect_text "12 of 20"
expect_unclipped "Check the plan" "Download" "Install" "Clean up" "Cancel the download"
# installing: not cancellable, Esc ignored
apt upgrade phase install
apt upgrade done 5
apt upgrade percent 25
apt upgrade text Installing tzdata (arm64)
wait 1500
shot upgrade_install
expect_text start "Installing 5 of 20"
expect_text "Do not switch off"
expect_unclipped "Check the plan" "Download" "Install" "Clean up" "Do not switch off"
# Esc while installing: ignored (the page stays, the helper gets no cancel)
key ESC
wait 400
expect_text start "Installing 5 of 20"
apt expect-cancel no
# done: the result page
apt upgrade state done
apt upgrade phase clean
apt upgrade done 20
apt upgrade percent 100
wait 1500
shot upgrade_result_ok
header upgrade_result_ok "Settings > Updates > Packages > Upgrade" "Updates > Packages > Upgrade" "Packages > Upgrade" Upgrade
key ESC
wait 1500
shot upgrade_back
expect_text "Refresh lists"
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
